WEBVTT

00:21:28.834 --> 00:21:31.296
This was a novel that I had dreamed up,

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.431
and the novel was going
to take place in the 1960s,

00:21:34.455 --> 00:21:36.640
and it was about
this spinster in Minnesota

00:21:36.664 --> 00:21:39.727
who worked for a large
international construction company.

00:21:39.751 --> 00:21:42.314
She's quietly in love
with her married boss

00:21:42.338 --> 00:21:44.737
and has been in love with
her married boss forever.

00:21:44.761 --> 00:21:47.886
He has a son who is a bit duplicitous
who takes over the business,

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:51.397
gets a contract to go down and build
a highway through the Amazon,

00:21:51.421 --> 00:21:55.434
which was a project that was attempted
in the 1960s but failed miserably.

00:21:55.458 --> 00:21:59.503
In my story, he goes down there,
gets involved with a bunch of corruption,

00:21:59.527 --> 00:22:02.000
he disappears, a bunch of money is lost,